## Part A — Software: All Rights Reserved

The following components are proprietary and confidential. Copyright is reserved
and no permission is granted to use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute,
sublicense, or create derivative works of them, in whole or in part, without
prior written permission from the copyright holders.

- `farmtrust_core/` — satellite time-series ingestion, preprocessing, smoothing,
  activity-cycle detection, and land assessment
- `api/` — backend service layer
- `portal/` — web frontend and report/export surfaces
- `scripts/` — operational and ingestion tooling
- `contracts/` — interface and schema definitions
- `tests/` — test suites
- All build, configuration, and dependency-lock files (`pyproject.toml`,
  `uv.lock`, `portal/package.json`, `portal/bun.lock`, and similar)
- All documentation, specifications, and engineering records under `docs/`,
  including `docs/PROJECT.md`, `docs/ENGINEERING.md`, `docs/PIPELINE.md`,
  `docs/UI.md`, `docs/DECISIONS.md`, and `docs/TASKS/`

Permitted without written consent:

- Reading, cloning, and running the software privately for evaluation, study,
  internal review, or academic assessment.
- Attributing and citing the work.

