merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and noninfringement. The
authors are not liable for any claim, damages, or other liability arising from,
out of, or in connection with this work or its use.

Satellite-derived evidence carries the limitations described in the project
documentation. This software is decision support for agricultural finance
review; it does not provide automated loan approval, legal land surveying, crop
identity proof, or yield guarantees.
